WEBVTT

00:06:27.454 --> 00:06:30.329
i šapati su krenuli,

00:06:30.371 --> 00:06:31.746
zurenja,

00:06:31.746 --> 00:06:33.663
podla smeškanja, cerekanja.

00:06:34.663 --> 00:06:40.038
I dan-danas sam nervozna među ljudima
zbog iskustva od pre osam godina.

00:06:41.913 --> 00:06:43.121
Izgubila sam nadu.

00:06:44.871 --> 00:06:45.954
Ne brinite.

00:06:45.954 --> 00:06:48.996
Bila sam na terapiji,
tako da sam okej, u redu sam sada.

00:06:49.038 --> 00:06:50.829
(Smeh)

00:06:50.871 --> 00:06:52.704
(Ovacije)

00:06:52.704 --> 00:06:56.829
(Aplauz)

00:06:56.871 --> 00:06:58.788
Ali što je dosta, dosta je,

00:06:58.788 --> 00:07:00.413
naučnica sam,